    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chicken vindaloo serves 4 and takes about 60 minutes plus marinating. Vinegar is the key, so marinate the chicken in the spice paste first. This one is hot, so adjust the chilli to your taste."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A splash of malt vinegar in the marinade gives the dish its signature tang."
          }
        ]
      },
